conform AtomicExchange<S8>, AtomicExchange<U8>, AtomicExchange<S16>, AtomicExchange<U16>, AtomicExchange<S32>, AtomicExchange<U32>, AtomicExchange<USize>, AtomicExchange<SSize>, AtomicExchange<Byte>, AtomicExchange<Addr>
